/ttml">把</span><span begin="2:34.001" end="2:34.353" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">我的</span><span begin="2:34.353" end="2:34.666" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">爱</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="2:34.676" end="2:35.235" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">用尽</span><span begin="2:35.235" end="2:35.539" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">后</span> <span begin="2:35.539" end="2:36.056" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">丢弃</span><span begin="2:36.056" end="2:36.353" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">荒</span><span begin="2:36.353" end="2:36.758" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">野</span><span begin="2:36.758" end="2:36.963" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">埋</span><span begin="2:36.963" end="2:37.775" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">葬</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="2:37.809" end="2:38.012" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">你</span><span begin="2:38.012" end="2:38.468" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">犯</span><span begin="2:38.468" end="2:38.708" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">的</span><span begin="2:38.708" end="2:39.108" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">罪</span><span begin="2:39.108" end="2:39.553" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">状</span> <span begin="2:39.553" end="2:40.337" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">没人</span><span begin="2:40.337" end="2:41.233" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">知道</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="2:41.500" end="2:41.837" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">用</span><span begin="2:41.837" end="2:42.551" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">什么</span><span begin="2:42.551" end="2:43.415" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">证明</span> <span begin="2:43.415" end="2:44.148" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">你的</span><span begin="2:44.148" end="2:44.636" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">亲</span><span begin="2:44.636" end="2:45.119" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">吻</span> <span begin="2:45.119" end="2:45.730" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">真</span><span begin="2:45.730" end="2:46.035" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/n